# Ship the SmoothQuant-style per-channel calibration as a vendored asset —
# small (~3.5MB), strictly an input-magnitude prior on the base DiT, not a
# checkpoint. Regenerate via `bench/channel_stats/analyze_lora_input_channels.py`.
!networks/calibration/channel_stats.safetensors
!networks/calibration/channel_stats_anima40.safetensors
!networks/calibration/cond_channel_stats.safetensors
# MOSS-Image's (scripts/calibration/moss_channel_stats.py), same role.
!library/moss/calibration/channel_stats.safetensors
!library/moss/calibration/channel_mean.safetensors
# The empty prompt's MOSS TE embedding (caption dropout's uncond); train.py re-encodes it if missing.
!library/moss/asset/empty_prompt.safetensors
